TY  - JOUR
ID  - arxiv-0707.3910v1
AU  - BOROS, GEORGE
AU  - MOLL, VICTOR H.
TI  - LANDEN TRANSFORMATIONS AND THE INTEGRATION OF RATIONAL FUNCTIONS
DA  - D:20210811
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/0707.3910
AB  - We present a rational version of the classical Landen transfor- mation for elliptic integrals. This is employed to obtain explicit closed-form expressions for a large class of integrals of even rational functions and to de- velop an algorithm for numerical integration of these functions.
